<title>CANADA: Molson Cos Ltd Q2 shr profit rises.</title>
<headline>Molson Cos Ltd Q2 shr profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>second quarter ended Sept. 30</p>
<p>				1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.36		   C$0.16</p>
<p> Net			 20,800		    9,200</p>
<p> Revs		     413,000		  396,400</p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.71		   C$0.50</p>
<p> Net			 41,600		   29,000</p>
<p> Revs		     812,800		  793,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  58,200		   57,900</p>
<p>		 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Revenues in above table do not include sales from discontinued operations. 1995 second quarter earnings included a C$10.8 million loss from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
